  "description": "Amplify your endurance ride with the all-new Roadmachine 01 AMP X, a road e-bike built to extend your reach. It unlocks hidden power thanks to the revolutionary TQ-HPR50 drive system and features a premium carbon frame and fork designed with the latest Tuned Compliance Concept Endurance technology. Internal cable routing, a premium carbon D-Shape seatpost, wide tire clearance and advanced ICS MTT x Redshift Suspension stem provide comfort over the rough stuff. Hit the road at speed with Roadmachine 01 AMP X ONE USA arriving with a SRAM FORCE XPLR eTap AXS 12-speed groupset, 35mm Pirelli Cinturato Gravel H tires and the powerful TQ-HPR50 class 3 drive unit with support up to 28mph.",
